menu "RLCD dashboard study"

config RLCD_DASHBOARD_LIVE
    bool "Use the live Observer USB dashboard"
    default y
    depends on !RLCD_DASHBOARD_STATIC
    help
        Request bounded current fleet views from the host bridge. Until a
        validated feed is available, show source loss with no work claims.
        Disable this and the static option to run the synthetic motion study.

config RLCD_DASHBOARD_STATIC
    bool "Use the earlier seven-screen static layout study"
    default n
    help
        Show the fixed-order CX/CC roster and diagnostic screens every
        twelve seconds instead of the synthetic urgency/age motion demo.

endmenu
